@startuml
title ioScope Scenario View - Configure FTDI Input and Tee-to-File
autonumber

actor User
participant ioQtScopeWindow as Window
participant ioOscilloscopeController as Controller
participant ioOscilloscopeModel as Model

User -> Window : choose source = "FTDI Device"
Window -> Controller : setInputSource("ftdi:0")
Controller -> Model : setInputSource("ftdi:0")
Controller -> Model : appendEvent("source_change")
Controller --> Window : render updated preview state

User -> Window : set FTDI In = 0
Window -> Controller : setFtdiInputDeviceIndex(0)
Controller -> Model : setFtdiInputDeviceIndex(0)
Controller -> Model : appendEvent("ftdi_input_device_change")
Controller --> Window : render updated preview state

User -> Window : check "Enable tee output"
Window -> Controller : setTeeOutputEnabled(true)
Controller -> Model : setTeeOutputEnabled(true)
Controller -> Model : appendEvent("tee_output_enabled_change")
Controller --> Window : render updated preview state

User -> Window : choose tee mode = "File"
Window -> Controller : setTeeOutputMode("file")
Controller -> Model : setTeeOutputMode("file")
Controller -> Model : appendEvent("tee_output_mode_change")
Controller --> Window : render updated preview state

User -> Window : enter tee path = "demo_ftdi_capture.bin"
Window -> Controller : setTeeOutputPath("demo_ftdi_capture.bin")
Controller -> Model : setTeeOutputPath("demo_ftdi_capture.bin")
Controller -> Model : appendEvent("tee_output_path_change")
Controller --> Window : render updated preview state

note over Window, Model
These interactions update control state before acquisition starts.
If the session is already running, the controller restarts the
live session so the new FTDI and tee-output settings take effect.
end note
@enduml
